  <h2 id="about-this-wiki">About This Wiki</h2>
  <p>Karinderya Wiki is an English-language player resource for the Karinderya Roblox experience. It organizes codes, food, ingredients, workers, equipment, furniture, decorations, updates, and gameplay guides into easy-to-browse pages.</p>

  <h2 id="browse-the-database">Browse the Database</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><a href="/codes/">Codes</a> lists reward codes and redemption guidance.</li>
    <li><a href="/food/">Food</a>, <a href="/recipes/">Recipes</a>, and <a href="/ingredients/">Ingredients</a> cover the kitchen and customer orders.</li>
    <li><a href="/workers/">Workers</a> covers temporary staff contracts.</li>
    <li><a href="/equipment/">Equipment</a> and <a href="/furniture/">Furniture</a> cover restaurant upgrades.</li>
    <li><a href="/guides/">Guides</a> provides practical help for running a Karinderya.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2 id="game-updates">Game Updates</h2>
  <p>Karinderya can change over time. The <a href="/updates/">Updates section</a> groups new features with the related database and guide pages so players can quickly find what changed.</p>

  <h2 id="independent-player-resource">Independent Player Resource</h2>
  <p>Karinderya Wiki is a fan-made player resource and is not affiliated with Roblox Corporation, SILOG, or the Karinderya development team.</p>
</ContentPage>
